    "wikipedia_summary": "<i><b>Avellinia</b></i> is a genus of Mediterranean plants in the grass family. The only known species is <i><b>Avellinia festucoides</b></i>, found throughout much of the Mediterranean Region from Portugal and Morocco to Turkey. It is also reportedly naturalized in Australia.",
